{"id":"level-up-2026-10-15","name":"2026-10-15 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1351","en":"The tutor agreed to extend the deadline by two days.","zh":"导师同意将截止日期延后两天。","note":"extend · 延长； 扩大 · extend a deadline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1352","en":"Fold the paper in half before cutting along the edge.","zh":"沿着边缘裁剪之前，先把纸对折。","note":"fold · 折叠；皱； 折 · fold in half","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1353","en":"Her interpretation of the poem differs from the textbook's account.","zh":"她对这首诗的解读与课本中的说法不同。","note":"interpretation · 口译； 解释， 诠释； 艺术处理 · a different interpretation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1354","en":"He watched a child hurl a stone into the pond.","zh":"他看着一个孩子把石头用力扔进池塘。","note":"hurl · 猛投， 猛摔； 大声叫骂 · hurl a stone","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1355","en":"The intermediate course assumes students already understand basic sentence patterns.","zh":"这门中级课程假定学生已经理解基本句型。","note":"intermediate · 中间的， 中级的 · an intermediate course","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1356","en":"These instructions presuppose knowledge that many first-time users do not have.","zh":"这些指示预设了许多初次使用者并不具备的知识。","note":"presuppose · 预先假定…属实； 认为， 假设； 以…为先决条件， 以…为前提 · presuppose knowledge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1357","en":"After careful consideration, we chose the smaller and quieter flat.","zh":"仔细考虑后，我们选了那套更小、更安静的公寓。","note":"consideration · 考虑； 思考； 体谅 · careful consideration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1358","en":"The philosophy class debated how humans should treat sentient beings.","zh":"哲学课讨论了人类应该如何对待有感知能力的生物。","note":"sentient · 有感觉能力的， 有知觉力的； 知悉的 · sentient beings","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1359","en":"We had a frank discussion about why the project failed.","zh":"我们坦率地讨论了项目失败的原因。","note":"frank · 坦白的， 直率的 · a frank discussion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1360","en":"The artist will inscribe your name beneath the finished portrait.","zh":"画家会在完成的肖像下方题上你的名字。","note":"inscribe · 写、 题、 铭刻； 牢记， 铭记 · inscribe a name","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1361","en":"Delaying essential repairs could exacerbate the building's existing structural problems.","zh":"推迟必要维修可能会加剧这座建筑现有的结构问题。","note":"exacerbate · 恶化， 加剧 · exacerbate a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1362","en":"The main road flooded; consequently, deliveries arrived several hours late.","zh":"主路积水了，因此送货晚到了几个小时。","note":"consequently · 因此， 因而 · consequently","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1363","en":"A computer virus prevented staff from opening their files.","zh":"一种电脑病毒使员工无法打开文件。","note":"virus · 病毒 · computer virus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1364","en":"Without internet access, we had recourse to a printed map.","zh":"无法上网，我们只好求助于纸质地图。","note":"recourse · 依靠； 求助， 求援 · have recourse to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1365","en":"She works for a multinational company with offices across Europe.","zh":"她为一家在欧洲各地设有办事处的跨国公司工作。","note":"multinational · 多国的，多民族的；跨国公司的；跨国公司 · a multinational company","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1366","en":"Several native bird species face extinction as their habitats disappear.","zh":"随着栖息地消失，几种本地鸟类面临灭绝。","note":"extinction · 灭绝， 绝种； 熄灭 · face extinction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1367","en":"The writer develops an extended metaphor comparing memory to a river.","zh":"作者展开了一个把记忆比作河流的延伸隐喻。","note":"metaphor · 隐喻， 暗喻 · an extended metaphor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1368","en":"The walking club gained popularity after introducing shorter weekend routes.","zh":"步行俱乐部推出较短的周末路线后变得更受欢迎。","note":"popularity · 普及， 流行 · gain popularity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1369","en":"Campaigners criticised the inhumane conditions inside the overcrowded animal shelter.","zh":"活动人士批评了这家拥挤的动物收容所内不人道的条件。","note":"inhumane · 不近人情的， 残忍的， 不人道的 · inhumane conditions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1370","en":"Completing one chapter each week seemed an attainable goal.","zh":"每周完成一章似乎是一个可以实现的目标。","note":"attainable · 可获得的， 可达到的， 可实现的 · an attainable goal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1371","en":"The photographs remind viewers of the shared humanity behind cultural differences.","zh":"这些照片提醒观众，文化差异背后有着共同的人性。","note":"humanity · 人类，人；人性；人道，仁慈； · shared humanity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1372","en":"The workshop encourages innovation by giving students unusual design challenges.","zh":"这个工作坊通过让学生面对不同寻常的设计挑战来鼓励创新。","note":"innovation · 革新， 创新 · encourage innovation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1373","en":"The museum does not charge a fee for school visits.","zh":"博物馆不向学校参观团收费。","note":"charge · 索取， 要价； 控告， 指控； 委以； 指示； 充电；价钱，费用；管理；照管；掌管；控告，指控；电荷，电量 · charge a fee","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1374","en":"The acrobat swung from a flying trapeze above the audience.","zh":"杂技演员在观众上方的高空秋千上荡来荡去。","note":"trapeze · 高空秋千； 吊架 · a flying trapeze","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1375","en":"I pressed the camera shutter just as the bird landed.","zh":"鸟刚落下时，我按下了相机快门。","note":"shutter · 百叶窗； 快门 · camera shutter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1376","en":"We alternate between indoor practice and outdoor matches each week.","zh":"我们每周交替进行室内训练和户外比赛。","note":"alternate · 轮流， 交替；轮流的； 间隔的； 交替的 · alternate between","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1377","en":"The old house has thick adobe walls and a flat roof.","zh":"这座老房子有厚厚的土坯墙和一个平屋顶。","note":"adobe · 土坯， 泥砖 · adobe walls","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1378","en":"The film crew tried to recreate a busy nineteenth-century market.","zh":"摄制组试图重现一个繁忙的十九世纪市场。","note":"recreate · 再现， 再创造 · recreate a scene","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1379","en":"The documentary follows researchers working deep inside a tropical forest.","zh":"这部纪录片跟拍了在热带森林深处工作的研究人员。","note":"tropical · 热带的； 炎热的 · tropical forest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1380","en":"I could barely decipher the handwriting on the faded postcard.","zh":"我几乎辨认不出那张褪色明信片上的字迹。","note":"decipher · 破译； 解释 · decipher handwriting","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1381","en":"Independent cafés began to burgeon near the newly opened university.","zh":"新建大学附近的独立咖啡馆开始迅速增多。","note":"burgeon · 迅速成长； 发展 · begin to burgeon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1382","en":"He practised answering questions before his first job interview.","zh":"第一次求职面试前，他练习了如何回答问题。","note":"interview · 接见， 会见； 采访； 面试 · a job interview","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1383","en":"It was naive to assume everyone would support the change.","zh":"以为所有人都会支持这一改变，是很天真的。","note":"naive · 幼稚的， 天真的， 不成熟的 · a naive assumption","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1384","en":"A reliable torch is essential equipment for exploring these caves.","zh":"探索这些洞穴时，可靠的手电筒是必备装备。","note":"essential · 本质的，基本的；必要的，必不可少的；极其重要的；要素； 实质， 本质； 要点 · essential equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1385","en":"Preparations for the exhibition continued apace throughout the weekend.","zh":"整个周末，展览的筹备工作都在快速进行。","note":"apace · 快速地， 急速地 · continue apace","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1386","en":"The software can encode information in a small square barcode.","zh":"这款软件可以将信息编码存入小型方形条码。","note":"encode · 把译成电码， 把…编码 · encode information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1387","en":"Could you clarify the final point before we move on?","zh":"在我们继续之前，你能把最后一点解释清楚吗？","note":"clarify · 澄清； 阐明 · clarify a point","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1388","en":"Workers inspected the steel furnace before starting the morning shift.","zh":"工人们开始早班前检查了炼钢炉。","note":"furnace · 熔炉 · a steel furnace","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1389","en":"Sudden movements may scare away the birds near the hide.","zh":"突然的动作可能会吓跑观察棚附近的鸟。","note":"scare · 吓， 使害怕； 受惊吓， 感到害怕；惊恐，恐慌 · scare away","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1390","en":"A loud clap of thunder interrupted our conversation on the balcony.","zh":"一声响雷打断了我们在阳台上的谈话。","note":"thunder · 打雷； 轰隆响；雷；雷声 · a clap of thunder","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1391","en":"We could not see the riverbed through the murky water.","zh":"透过浑浊的河水，我们看不见河床。","note":"murky · 浑浊的； 黑暗的； 朦胧的； 隐晦的 · murky water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1392","en":"Students observe the insects closely before drawing their wings.","zh":"学生们先仔细观察昆虫，然后再画它们的翅膀。","note":"observe · 察觉； 观察； 遵守 · observe closely","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1393","en":"She wanted meaningful work that would benefit her local community.","zh":"她希望做能造福当地社区的有意义的工作。","note":"meaningful · 有目的的； 有意义的 · meaningful work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1394","en":"We used second-hand furniture to furnish the spare room.","zh":"我们用二手家具布置了那间空房。","note":"furnish · 布置， 为…配备家具； 供应， 提供； 装备 · furnish a room","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1395","en":"Our exploratory study identified questions worth investigating in greater detail.","zh":"我们的探索性研究发现了值得进一步详细调查的问题。","note":"exploratory · 探测的； 勘探的； 探索的 · an exploratory study","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-15:s1396","en":"Several residents criticised the decision to remove the old trees.","zh":"几位居民批评了移除老树的决定。","note":"criticise · 批评， 非难， 责备； 评论 · criticise a decision","recordings":[]},{"id":"cat